  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (2)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (2) is a tiny, thin-flat component located at the
    bottom-center-front of the engine, made of Material.003, which plays a crucial
    role in sealing the oil pan to prevent oil leaks. Its position and material ensure
    a tight seal, and an interesting detail is that it is designed to withstand high
    temperatures.
